          <definition>To classify, categorize.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠠᠶᠢᠮᠠᠬ ᠤᠨ ᠶᠠᠮᠤᠨ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- un jamun</transcript>
          <definition>Aimak administration.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠠᠶᠢᠮᠠᠬ ᠤᠨ ᠨᠣᠶᠠᠨ</unicode>
